            $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name=$pepper-vinyl/answer
            ^gotoReactivate(play_vinyl)



proposal: %recommendation
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet=execute_computing-recommendations
    ^start(animations/Stand/Waiting/Think_2)
    I will compute some recommendations based on your interactions, it might take a while so wait here!
